# Privacy Policy – Lars Gym

**Last updated: September 22, 2026**

Lars Gym respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information the Lars Gym app may collect and how that information is used.

## Information We Collect

Lars Gym may collect information that you provide when using the app, such as:

* Name or profile information
* Workout and exercise progress
* App preferences and settings
* Information needed to provide notifications and reminders

We only collect information that is necessary to provide and improve the app.

## How We Use Your Information

Your information may be used to:

* Provide and personalize the Lars Gym experience
* Track workout progress
* Provide scheduled workout notifications and reminders
* Maintain and improve the app
* Fix technical problems and improve app performance

We do not sell your personal information to third parties.

## Data Storage and Security

We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your information against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.

Personal information is retained only for as long as necessary for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law.

## Third-Party Services

Lars Gym may use third-party services for functions such as app analytics, notifications, authentication, hosting, or payment processing. These services may process information on our behalf and are required to handle information in accordance with applicable privacy laws.

## Your Rights

Under applicable data protection laws, including the GDPR, you may have the right to:

* Request access to your personal information
* Request correction of inaccurate information
* Request deletion of your information
* Request restriction of certain processing
* Object to certain processing
* Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent

You may contact us to exercise these rights.

## Children's Privacy

Lars Gym is not specifically directed toward children. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children without appropriate authorization where required by applicable law.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be published with an updated "Last updated" date.

